 "text": "It seems the FDA has finally decided to cross the Rubicon and published a new and revolutionary regulatory framework which aims to expedite the regulatory approval process of new Gene Editing-based treatments - such as $BEAM Base Editing and $PRME Prime Editing.\n\nThese new https://t.co/otTytrJrop https://t.co/WkuF1PhFev", "url": "https://x.com/yaireinhorn/status/2115478728046190941"}, {"author_id": "2801692272", "created_at": "2026-10-27T19:23:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115162579265843222"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 24, "start": 19, "tag": "PRME"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3y6QmRmczj", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LordHodler/status/2115162579265843222/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115162569656664064", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/3y6QmRmczj"}]}, "id": "2115162579265843222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 2108, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "The FDA just wrote $PRME 's business model into draft regulation.\n\nNew guidance creates an \"Individualized Feature Space.\" Once a genome editing product is approved, you add new variants for other mutations in the same gene by supplement, on in vitro data. No new trial. Same LNP, https://t.co/3y6QmRmczj", "url": "https://x.com/LordHodler/status/2115162579265843222"}, {"author_id": "1912348949261807616", "created_at": "2026-10-28T13:46:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115440007615787424", "2115440170900074589", "2115440268925124763"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 20, "start": 15, "tag": "PRME"}, {"end": 82, "start": 77, "tag": "BEAM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/21U1L4Fwgq", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jawnzilla/status/2115440007615787424/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115439994747629569", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/21U1L4Fwgq"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/21U1L4Fwgq", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jawnzilla/status/211544000761578742